    {
      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "早上好，张伟。今天来得很早啊。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "早上好。我想早点儿开始，今天事情不少。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "你先看一下今天的安排吧。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我刚看了，上午有一个小会。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "对，十点开始，大概半个小时。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "开会以后，我要把昨天的工作做完。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "那个不难，不过要仔细一点儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我知道。昨天有两个地方我不太确定。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "没关系，一会儿我可以帮你看看。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "谢谢。你今天忙吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "上午比较忙，下午会轻松一点儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我先自己做，有问题再问你。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "好。你现在越来越熟悉这里了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "是啊，第一天的时候我什么都要问。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "慢慢来，习惯以后就快了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我也是这么想的。今天先把三件事做好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "很好，有计划就不容易乱。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc001_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我开始了，中午一起吃饭吧。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
